cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Orbivo in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Orbivo: 360° and 180° video player with spatial sound for the Varjo XR-3"
abstract: >-
  Windows player for 360° and 180° videos (up to 8K, mono and stereo) on a Varjo XR-3, controlled by an operator
  at the desktop. Spatial sound (stereo and Ambisonics) is rendered binaurally in the player and follows head
  rotation; head movement and operator events can be recorded as CSV.
authors:
  - name: QuenCode
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/QuenCode/Orbivo"
keywords:
  - 360-degree video
  - virtual reality
  - OpenXR
  - Varjo XR-3
  - Ambisonics
  - binaural audio
  - head tracking
